{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "\n\n示例那笔**不会**进导出 —— 备份是你的数据,不该混进我编的那笔。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nThe sample trade is **not** exported — a backup is your data, not something I made up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n★ 现在统计的是**全部历史**,和上面的周期数字不是一回事。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n★ This is now **all history**, not the same thing as the period figure above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n已抓到真实分钟 K:%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nReal minute bars fetched: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ %2$lld 根": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@, %2$lld bars"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ · %2$lld 笔\n恢复时**只补不覆盖**:你现在已有的记录一条都不会被改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$lld trades\nRestoring **only fills gaps, never overwrites**: nothing you already have will be changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
