            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld trades answered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 腿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld legs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(你实际 %@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(you got %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%1$@ 这一段 %2$lld 笔,最好的一笔只有 %3$@** —— 随便挑 %2$lld 笔都这么小的概率 %4$@。这一段从来没赚到过大钱。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%1$@: %2$lld trades, and the best one is only %3$@** — the chance of any %2$lld random trades being this small is %4$@. This slot has never produced a big win."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%1$@ 这一段 %2$lld 笔,最好的一笔只有 %3$@** —— 随便挑 %2$lld 笔都这么小的概率 %4$@。这一段从来没赚到过大钱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**%1$@ 这一段 %2$lld 笔,最差的一笔也只有 %3$@** —— 随便挑 %2$lld 笔都这么轻的概率 %4$@。这一段从来没亏过大钱。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%1$@: %2$lld trades, and the worst one is only %3$@** — the chance of any %2$lld random trades being this mild is %4$@. This slot has never produced a big loss."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%1$@ 这一段 %2$lld 笔,最差的一笔也只有 %3$@** —— 随便挑 %2$lld 笔都这么轻的概率 %4$@。这一段从来没亏过大钱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**App 里比券商多 %lld 笔。**多半是重复导入了 —— 「数据与备份」里有「清理重复」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**There are %lld more trades here than at your broker.** Most likely a duplicate import — Data & Backup has \"Remove duplicates\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**iOS 不允许 App 自己往 iCloud Drive 里写** —— 要么花 $99 申请 iCloud 容器,要么**由你亲手选一次文件夹**。选完系统会给 App 一张凭证,之后每天自动写、不再问你。\n★ 选在 iCloud Drive 里就等于备份到 iCloud;文件也能在「文件」App 里直接看到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**iOS does not let an app write into iCloud Drive on its own** — either you pay $99 for an iCloud container, or **you pick a folder yourself, once**. After that the system hands the app a token and it writes there every day without asking again.\n★ Pick a folder inside iCloud Drive and it is backed up to iCloud; the files are also visible in the Files app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**差 %lld 笔没进来。**\n漏掉的**不是随机样本** —— 亏损单更烦、更不想记,技术上也更容易出岔子。两边叠加,统计会**系统性偏乐观**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**%lld trades never made it in.**\nWhat goes missing is **not a random sample** — losing trades are more annoying to log, and they are also more likely to hit a technical snag. Both push the same way, so the stats end up **systematically optimistic**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**无损**,而且**能导回来** —— 一个导不回去的导出不叫备份。\n\n导回时**不替换任何一笔**,但会**把你还空着的字段补上**(收盘价、峰值、期权真实价)。**你自己填过的值一个都不会动。**\n\n★ 期权的真实收盘价 App 里取不到(没有免费源)。有 moomoo 的话,在电脑上跑 `tools/moomoo_enrich.py` 把备份补全再导回来 —— 实测能拿到到期日收盘价和持仓期间的分钟路径。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Lossless**, and it **restores** — an export you can't restore isn't a backup.\n\nRestoring **replaces nothing**, but it **fills in fields you left blank** (closing price, peak, real option price). **Nothing you typed yourself is touched.**\n\n★ Real option closing prices aren't available in-app (no free source). If you have moomoo, run `tools/moomoo_enrich.py` on your computer to complete the backup, then restore it — it does get expiry-day closes and the minute-by-minute path while you held."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**时段之间的差别,和随机分组差不多大**(p = %@)—— 上面的高低大部分是巧合,别当成规律。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The differences between slots are about what random grouping gives** (p = %@) — most of the highs and lows above are chance; don't read them as a pattern."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**时段之间的差别,和随机分组差不多大**(p = %@)—— 上面的高低大部分是巧合,别当成规律。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**格子怎么读**\n· 空格 = 那天没交易,**不是持平**\n· 琥珀色 = 那天开了仓、还没平\n· 有框的那一格 = 今天\n· 点有颜色的格子 = 看那天的交易": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Reading the grid**\n· Empty = no trades that day, **not break-even**\n· Amber = opened a position that day, still open\n· Outlined = today\n· Tap a colored cell = see that day's trades"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**格子怎么读**\n· 空格 = 那天没交易,**不是持平**\n· 琥珀色 = 那天开了仓、还没平\n· 有框的那一格 = 今天\n· 点有颜色的格子 = 看那天的交易"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**赢的次数多,但每次赢得少。** 胜率 \\(pct)%,可平均赚 \\(money(w)) / 平均亏 \\(money(l)) —— 盈亏比 \\(ratio)。\n★ 图上右边很密、左边很长,就是这个意思。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**You win often, but small.** Win rate \\(pct)%, yet avg win \\(money(w)) vs avg loss \\(money(l)) — payoff ratio \\(ratio).\n★ That's what the dense right side and the long left tail mean."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**赢的次数多,但每次赢得少。** 胜率 \\(pct)%,可平均赚 \\(money(w)) / 平均亏 \\(money(l)) —— 盈亏比 \\(ratio)。\n★ 图上右边很密、左边很长,就是这个意思。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**赢的次数少,但每次赢得多。** 胜率 \\(pct)%,盈亏比 \\(ratio) —— 这是靠少数几笔撑起来的形状。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**You win rarely, but big.** Win rate \\(pct)%, payoff ratio \\(ratio) — a shape carried by a few trades."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**赢的次数少,但每次赢得多。** 胜率 \\(pct)%,盈亏比 \\(ratio) —— 这是靠少数几笔撑起来的形状。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**趁还记得**逐条过一遍。攒够几笔之后,历史页会告诉你**哪一条最常破、破了那些单亏了多少** —— 那才是这张表的用处。\n★ 拿不准的**就别勾**:没勾不会被算成「做到了」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go through it **while you still remember**. After a few trades, History will tell you **which rule you break most and what those trades cost** — that is what this list is for.\n★ If you are not sure, **leave it blank**: blank is never counted as \"kept\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ",深度加仓": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
