          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 里记了 %lld 笔 —— 券商月结单上是几笔?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld recorded here — how many on the broker statement?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 里记了 %lld 笔 —— 券商月结单上是几笔?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BS 重定价 · IV %1$.2f%%(由出场成交反解)· %2$@ 口径": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Black–Scholes reprice · IV %1$.2f%% (back-solved from your exit) · %2$@ basis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call/Put(算术显示乘数=100,应该是期权)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Call/Put (the arithmetic closes with a ×100 multiplier — this should be an option)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IV 由**各腿自己的成交价**反解,**交易时间口径**(252 交易日 × 6.5 小时)。换成日历口径会得到 2 倍量级的数 —— 那是错的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IV is back-solved from **each leg's own fill price**, on a **trading-time basis** (252 days × 6.5 hours). Switching to calendar time gives a number roughly twice as large — and that one is wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Micro 原油": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Micro Crude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Micro 黄金": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Micro Gold"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "R:R %@ **低于你自己定的 1.5** —— 现在还来得及不做。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "R:R %@ is **below your own 1.5** — there is still time to skip this one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TradingView / Webull 的图表没有成交明细,不做识别 —— 但它是你当时看到的东西。和上面的原话一样,复盘时最该回看的就是这两样。图只存在本机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TradingView / Webull charts carry no fill details, so nothing is parsed from them — but they're what you were looking at. Together with your own words above, these are the two things most worth revisiting. Images stay on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v%1$@ · 构建 %2$@-%3$@ %4$@:%5$@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "v%1$@ · build %2$@-%3$@ %4$@:%5$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v3.2 之前录入页的默认时刻就是 **11:00** —— 这几笔很可能没填过时间。真是 11:00 成交就不用管;不是的话点「改」补上,**盈亏和所有统计都不受影响**,只是时刻显示会准。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before v3.2 the entry form defaulted to **11:00** — these fills probably never had a time entered. If 11:00 is right, ignore this; if not, tap \"Edit\" and fill it in. **P&L and every statistic are unaffected** — only the displayed time gets accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 其中 %lld 笔能比较": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· %lld of them comparable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 在手 %lld 笔未平": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· %lld still open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 样本太少,别当结论": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Too few trades — don't treat this as a conclusion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⏰ 带 **?** 的时刻是**默认值**,不是成交时刻 —— 点一下时间选对,它才会被记成事实。不改也能存,但复盘页那里会显示 `--:--`。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⏰ A time marked **?** is a **default**, not the fill time — tap it and set the real one to have it recorded as fact. You can still save without it, but the review page will show `--:--`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ **止损一次都没被触发** —— 风控从未经检验。这不是「风控好」,是「还没遇到过」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ **Your stop was never once hit** — your risk control has never been tested. That isn't 「good risk control」, it's 「hasn't happened yet」."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 事后补的**不参与任何统计** —— 你已经知道结果了,这时候选的心情必然被结果带着走。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ Anything recorded after the fact **counts toward no statistic** — you already know the outcome, so whatever you pick is dragged along by it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 其中 %lld 笔算不出百分比(贷记开仓没有可信的分母),没进上面那一行的平均。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ %lld of them have no percentage (credit opens have no trustworthy denominator) and are left out of that row's average."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ 其中 %lld 笔算不出百分比(贷记开仓没有可信的分母),没进上面那一行的平均。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 填上券商那个数,才知道这个月的统计**完不完整**。App 里的数字自己证明不了自己。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ Enter your broker’s number to find out whether this month’s stats are **complete**. Numbers inside the app cannot vouch for themselves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 才 **\\(s.n) 笔**,形状还说明不了什么 —— 攒到二三十笔再看这张图。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ Only **\\(s.n) trades** — the shape doesn't mean much yet. Come back around 20–30."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ 才 **\\(s.n) 笔**,形状还说明不了什么 —— 攒到二三十笔再看这张图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 漏掉的那几笔**多半不是随机的** —— 亏的那天更容易嫌烦不记。历史页上每一个数字都会因此偏乐观。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ The missing ones are **probably not random** — losing days are the ones you skip. Every number on the history page is optimistic by that much."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ 漏掉的那几笔**多半不是随机的** —— 亏的那天更容易嫌烦不记。历史页上每一个数字都会因此偏乐观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 现在统计的是**全部历史**,和上面的周期数字不是一回事。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ This now counts **all history** — not the same thing as the period number above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ 现在统计的是**全部历史**,和上面的周期数字不是一回事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 移动止损是**这条腿自己价格**的回撤 —— 不是标的的,也不是账户的。复盘页那条「若挂移动止损」用的就是这个数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ The trailing stop is a drawdown on **this leg's own price** — not the underlying's, not the account's. The \"with a trailing stop\" line on the review page uses exactly this number."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ 移动止损是**这条腿自己价格**的回撤 —— 不是标的的,也不是账户的。复盘页那条「若挂移动止损」用的就是这个数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 规范 §2.7:关键发现常常来自措辞,而不是任何枚举字段。原话不做结构化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ Spec §2.7: the useful finding is usually in the wording, not in any dropdown. Raw notes stay unstructured."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 这一笔已经平了,所以**开单原因是事后回忆** —— 结果已知,回忆必然被结果带着走。它会被如实标成「事后补的」,历史页里单独计数。\n★ 止损止盈这里**不问**:平仓后填等于伪造当时的计划,风控统计会因此变成假的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ This trade is already closed, so **the entry reason is recalled after the fact** — you know the outcome, and recall gets dragged along by it. It is recorded as \"after the fact\" and counted separately in History.\n★ Stop and target are **not asked here**: filling them in after the exit would fabricate the plan you had at entry, and the risk stats would become fiction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 这些是**导进来但没成的**截图。留着它们是因为:漏掉的**不是随机样本** —— 亏损单更烦、更不想记,统计会因此偏乐观。\n历史页顶上的「对账」能算出这个月到底差几笔。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ These are screenshots you imported that **did not make it**. They are kept because what goes missing is **not a random sample** — losing trades are more annoying to log, so the stats drift optimistic.\n\"Reconcile\" at the top of History works out how many are missing this month."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 这份清单是**从你笔记本的照片里认出来的** —— 手写字我不敢保证全认对。\n带 **?** 的那几条是我**认不准**的,请对着本子核对一下;改错、删掉、加新的都行。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ This list was **read off the photos of your notebook** — I cannot promise I got every handwritten line right.\nThe ones marked **?** are the lines I was **unsure about**; please check them against the notebook. Edit, delete or add anything you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★ 这是**这条腿自己价格**的回撤 —— 不是标的的,也不是账户的。期权上 25% 比听起来紧得多 —— 复盘页那条「若挂移动止损」用的就是这个数。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★ This is a pullback in **this leg's own price** — not the underlying's, not your account's. On options 25% is far tighter than it sounds — it's the number behind 「if you'd used a trailing stop」 on the review page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★★ **不填这个数,日亏上限那条就判不了** —— 它会显示「判不了」,而不是「通过」。\n填了之后,主页会在你今天已经亏到上限时直接挂一条出来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ **Without this number the daily-loss rule cannot judge at all** — it will say \"can't tell\", not \"passed\".\nOnce set, the main screen raises a banner as soon as today's loss hits the cap."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ **不填这个数,日亏上限那条就判不了** —— 它会显示「判不了」,而不是「通过」。\n填了之后,主页会在你今天已经亏到上限时直接挂一条出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★★ **加仓 ≥3 次**的那 \\(deep.count) 笔合计 \\(money(d))。\n去掉它们,其余 \\(s.n - deep.count) 笔是 **\\(money(rest))** —— 这 \\(deep.count) 笔吃掉的比你全部净利润还多。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ The \\(deep.count) trades with **3+ adds** total \\(money(d)).\nWithout them the other \\(s.n - deep.count) come to **\\(money(rest))** — those \\(deep.count) ate more than your entire net profit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ **加仓 ≥3 次**的那 \\(deep.count) 笔合计 \\(money(d))。\n去掉它们,其余 \\(s.n - deep.count) 笔是 **\\(money(rest))** —— 这 \\(deep.count) 笔吃掉的比你全部净利润还多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★★ 其中 **%lld 笔碰到了止损位、你却没有按它出场**,而且最后还赚了钱。\n「这次扛过来了」会强化这个习惯 —— 而止损存在的意义,正是替你决定不许扛。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ On %lld of them **the price reached your stop and you didn't take it**, and the trade still ended green.\n「I rode it out this time」 is exactly how the habit gets reinforced — and the whole point of a stop is to make that decision for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "★★ 这是**唯一能查出「有交易没记进来」的办法**。\nApp 只知道你导进来的那些;没导的那些,它连不知道自己不知道。\n★ 对不上不一定是 bug —— 也可能是那天嫌烦没记。**知道差几笔本身就是信息。**": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ This is the **only way to find trades that never made it in**.\nThe app only knows what you imported; about the rest it doesn't even know that it doesn't know.\n★ A mismatch isn't necessarily a bug — some days you just didn't bother. **Knowing the size of the gap is itself the information.**"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "★★ 这是**唯一能查出「有交易没记进来」的办法**。\nApp 只知道你导进来的那些;没导的那些,它连不知道自己不知道。\n★ 对不上不一定是 bug —— 也可能是那天嫌烦没记。**知道差几笔本身就是信息。**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ 峰值是事后视角,没人卖得在最高点。这一项**不能**当作「应该拿更久」的依据 —— 看上面那条「持有到收盘」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠️ The peak is hindsight; nobody sells the exact top. This line **cannot** be used as evidence that you 「should have held longer」 — look at 「hold to close」 above instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "。另外给已有的 %1$lld 笔补上了 %2$lld 个空字段 —— **你自己填过的值一个都没动**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Also filled %2$lld blank fields across %1$lld existing trades — **nothing you typed yourself was touched**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%1$@」会多赚 **%2$@**": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%1$@\" would have made **%2$@** more"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%1$@」会多赚 **%2$@**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%1$@」比你**多赚** %2$@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%1$@」made **%2$@ more** than you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」累计比你多赚这么多": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」 made this much more than you, cumulatively"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「平一半 + 剩余移动止损」的完整版 —— 何时触发要分钟级路径": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The full 「scale out half + trail the rest」 — knowing when it triggers needs a minute-level path"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「持有到收盘会怎样」要**收盘时标的价**,「峰值出场」要**峰值时标的价**。两个都空着,这笔就只剩盈亏 —— 而盈亏你的券商 App 已经告诉你了。去复盘页顶上填一个,当天同标的的交易都能共用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「Hold to close」 needs **the underlying at the close**; 「exit at the peak」 needs **the underlying at its peak**. With both blank, all that's left is P&L — and your broker app already told you that. Fill one in at the top of the review page; every trade on that symbol that day shares it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「持有到收盘会更好」的次数越多,说明这一类单**你走得太早**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The more often \"held to close would have been better\", the more you are **leaving this kind of trade too early**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「提前手动平」这一行如果盈亏明显低于「触及目标」,那是纪律问题,不是运气。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If \"closed early by hand\" is clearly worse than \"hit target\", that is discipline, not luck."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「止损从未被触发」= 风控从未经检验。这类事实比任何胜率都重要。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「Your stop was never hit」 = your risk control has never been tested. Facts like this matter more than any win rate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「要避开的」勾 ✓ 表示**避开了**,勾 ✗ 表示**犯了**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For \"Avoid these\", ✓ means you **avoided it**, ✗ means you **did it**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
