    "一个字都没认出来": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No text recognised at all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一行 = **一笔成交**(不是一笔交易),所以加仓、分批平仓、多条腿都留得住;想按交易汇总,对 `trade_id` 做透视即可。\n\n**说清楚:CSV 是有损的,导不回来。** 要留退路请用上面的备份文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One row = **one fill** (not one trade), so add-ons, scaled exits and multiple legs all survive; to aggregate by trade, pivot on `trade_id`.\n\n**To be clear: CSV is lossy and can't be restored.** For a real fallback, use the backup file above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
