        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History **groups by this** — 「which kind of reason wins more often」 is far more useful than 「what's my win rate」."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史页会拿它和「触及目标」对照 —— **「提前手动平」的盈亏明显更低,那是纪律问题,不是运气**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
