    "右边那个数 = **破这一条的那些单,盈亏合计**。\n★ 没勾的不算「做到了」—— 所以这里的次数只会少算,不会多算。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The number on the right = **total P&L of the trades where this rule was broken**.\n★ Anything you left unticked does not count as \"kept\" — so these counts under-report, never over-report."
          }
        }
      }
    },
