    "同一合约的开仓与平仓已经自动配到一起了。核对无误再保存。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entries and exits on the same contract have been paired automatically. Check them, then save."
