    },
    "同一标的 %1$@ · 还有 %2$@ 未平": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same symbol %1$@ · %2$@ still open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同一笔交易被存了多份 —— **标的、合约、每一笔成交完全相同**。\n清理时每组**保留填得最多的那一份**(收盘价、心理、原因、路径都算),其余删掉。\n\n★ 起因是导入脚本每次生成新 id、而去重只看 id。现在两头都修了:脚本 id 固定,导入也按**内容**去重 —— 再导不会重复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same trade is stored more than once — **symbol, contract and every fill are identical**.\nCleanup **keeps the most complete copy** in each group (closing price, psychology, reason and path all count) and deletes the rest.\n\n★ The cause: the import script generated fresh ids every run, while dedup only looked at ids. Both ends are fixed now — ids are stable and import dedups by **content**, so re-importing won't duplicate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同上": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Same as above"
          }
