    "平 %1$@ @ %2$.2f,留 %3$@ 到强平 · ★这是你规则的简化版:去掉了「剩余移动止损」那条腿 —— 它要分钟级路径,而**期权的分钟价 App 内取不到**(股票/期货/外汇点「自动填」就有)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close %1$@ at %2$.2f, hold %3$@ to the forced exit · ★ This is a simplified version of your rule: the 「trail the remainder」 leg is dropped, because it needs a minute-level path and **option prices by the minute aren't available in-app** (stocks / futures / FX get them from 「Auto-fill」)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
