    "开着的话,打开一笔的复盘页时会去取**那天的分钟 K 线**,发出去的只有**代码和日期**。\n关掉之后只有你点「自动填标的价」才联网 —— 计算全在本机,任何时候都不上传你的交易。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, opening a trade’s review page fetches **that day’s minute candles** — all that leaves the device is **a symbol and a date**.\nTurn it off and nothing goes out until you tap \"Auto-fill underlying\". Everything is computed on device; your trades are never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
