    "截图上写着「**Sell to close / 平仓**」,但这边没有这张合约的未平仓记录。\n\n把**开仓那张**也导进来,两张会并成一笔 —— 到时候盈亏是**算出来的**,不需要截图上印着金额。\n\n要是现在就记,它会被当成**新开的空头仓位**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The screenshot says **\"Sell to close\"**, but there is no open position in this contract here.\n\nImport the **opening screenshot** too — the two will be merged into one trade, and the P&L is then **computed**, with no need for any amount printed on the screenshot.\n\nIf you record it now, it will be treated as a **newly opened short position**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
