    "数据只在这台设备上,**从不上传**。iPhone 的整机备份会带上它,所以**换手机不会丢**;但**误删 App 会**。这就是上面那两个按钮存在的原因。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data lives on this device and is **never uploaded**. An iPhone device backup includes it, so **switching phones won't lose it** — but **deleting the app by mistake will**. That's why the two buttons above exist."
          }
        }
