    },
    "时刻按交易所时区(纽约)。\n★ `--:--` = **这笔成交的时间没填过** —— 录入时留的是默认值,不是券商给的。点右上角「改」补上,盈亏不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Times are in exchange time (New York).\n★ `--:--` = **no time was entered for that fill** — what was saved is the default, not something your broker gave. Tap \"Edit\" to fill it in; P&L is unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "时刻按交易所时区(纽约)。\n★ 这几笔**正好都是 11:00** —— 那是 v3.2 之前录入页的默认时刻,很可能没填过。真是 11:00 成交就不用管;不是的话点「改」补上,**盈亏和统计都不受影响**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Times are in exchange time (New York).\n★ These fills are **all exactly 11:00** — that was the entry form’s default before v3.2, so a time was probably never entered. If 11:00 is right, ignore this; if not, tap \"Edit\" and fill it in. **P&L and statistics are unaffected.**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
