          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Underlying %1$@, %2$lld bars"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的 %1$@ 在 %2$@ 触及 %3$.2f,这条腿**当时的真实价** %4$.2f/张 —— 不是模型估的": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ hit %3$.2f at %2$@, and this leg's **actual price at that moment** was %4$.2f each — not a model estimate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的 %1$@,行权价 %2$@ —— 差了 %3$d%%。确认没打错位?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Underlying %1$@, strike %2$@ — that's %3$d%% away. Sure you didn't slip a digit?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的 %@ 当天走势": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ price action that day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的(如 QQQ / TSLA / ES)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Symbol (e.g. QQQ / TSLA / ES)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的(如 QQQ)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Symbol (e.g. QQQ)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的、张数、成交价都认好了,你只需确认。**永不自动保存。**": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Symbol, size and fill price are read for you — you just confirm. **Nothing is ever saved automatically.**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的价(可空)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Underlying (opt.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的价可以不填。它只在**平仓那一笔**用得上(反解 IV 算峰值重定价),留空只少「若在峰值出场」一条。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The underlying price is optional. It's only used on **the closing fill** (to back-solve IV for the peak reprice); leaving it out only costs you the 「exit at the peak」 line."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的价截图里没有 —— 留空即可,只影响「若在峰值出场」那一条。收盘价在复盘页填一次,当天同标的全部交易共用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The underlying price isn't in the screenshot — leave it blank; it only affects 「exit at the peak」. Fill the closing price once on the review page and every trade on that symbol that day shares it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的当时 %1$@,行权价 %2$@ 的 %3$@ 内在价值就有 %4$@,**期权价不可能低于内在价值**。现在填的是 %5$@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The underlying was %1$@, so a %2$@ %3$@ already has %4$@ of intrinsic value. **An option can't trade below intrinsic.** You entered %5$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标的收于 %1$.2f,行权价 %2$@ —— 这是**放到到期**的结果(归零)。若是收盘时卖掉,末日权还有几分钱时间价值,填进去这条才准": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The underlying closed at %1$.2f against a %2$@ strike — this is what **letting it expire** gives you (zero). If you'd sold at the close, a 0DTE still carries a few cents of time value; enter it and this line becomes accurate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样本 < 10,**这里不显示胜率** —— n 太小时胜率是有害的伪精确。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fewer than 10 trades, so **no win rate is shown** — at this sample size a win rate is harmful false precision."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样本仍偏少。可以说「N 笔里有 M 笔出现了 X」,**不能**说这是你的倾向。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Still a small sample. You may say 「X happened in M of N trades」; you may **not** say it's a tendency of yours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样本太少,下面的数**不能用来下结论**。只能当作「N 笔里的第 M 笔」来看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too few trades — the numbers below **cannot support a conclusion**. Read them as 「trade M of N」, nothing more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样本量够做分组统计了,但每个结论仍须连同样本数一起看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enough trades to group by, but every conclusion still has to be read together with its sample size."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核对一眼": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check it over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
