    "横轴不是时间 —— 只画「出场」这一个分岔口。实线是你,虚线是你没走的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The x-axis isn't time — it's just the exit fork. Solid is you; dashed is the road not taken."
