    },
    "横轴不是时间刻度 —— 这张图只画「出场决定」这一个分岔口,表示的是「出场决定之前 / 之后」,不是时间的推移。真实的走势看上面那张 K 线。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The x-axis is not a time scale — this chart draws one fork, the exit decision, and means 「before / after that decision」, not the passage of time. For the actual price action see the candles above."
          }
