          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天第一次打开 App 时写一份,**同一天只写一份**,最多留 30 天。\n★ 选在 iCloud Drive 里的文件夹,就等于每天自动备份到 iCloud。\n★ 刚写完时「文件」App 里可能带个上传中的小云朵 —— **那是在同步,不是没写成**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes one file the first time you open the app each day — **one per day**, keeping the last 30.\n★ Pick a folder inside iCloud Drive and that is exactly \"back up to iCloud every day\".\n★ Right after writing, the Files app may show a small uploading cloud — **that is syncing, not a failure**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
