    "行权价填的是 %1$@,而 %2$@ × %3$@ × %4$d = %5$@ —— **总金额被当成行权价了**。标的当时 %6$@,行权价 %1$@ 的 %7$@ 至少值 %8$@,不可能是 %3$@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The strike is entered as %1$@, but %2$@ × %3$@ × %4$d = %5$@ — **the total cost was put in the strike field**. The underlying was %6$@ at the time, so a %1$@ %7$@ is worth at least %8$@; it cannot be %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
