      }
    },
    "计算全在本机。**不连券商、不注册账号、没有广告。**\n只有你点「自动填标的价」时才联网,发出去的只有代码和日期。\n不提供投资建议,不给买卖信号 —— 只对你自己录入的、已经发生的交易做计算。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything is computed on this device. **No broker connection, no account, no ads.**\nIt only touches the network when you tap 「Auto-fill underlying」, and all that leaves is a ticker and a date.\nNo investment advice, no buy/sell signals — it only computes on trades you entered yourself, that already happened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "计算全在本机。**不连券商、不注册账号、没有广告。**\n联网只有一件事:取行情(代码 + 日期)。打开复盘页会自动补那天的 K 线,**这条可以在数据页关掉**。\n不提供投资建议,不给买卖信号 —— 只对你自己录入的、已经发生的交易做计算。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything is computed on device. **No broker connection, no account, no ads.**\nThe network is used for exactly one thing: quotes (a symbol and a date). Opening a review page fetches that day’s candles — **you can turn that off in Data & Backup**.\nNo investment advice and no buy/sell signals — it only computes on trades you entered yourself, that already happened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
