    "这一栏**不会**事后重算。事后重算带幸存者偏差,而且会丢掉「警告过、仍然做了」这条行为记录 —— 那才是最能预测未来违规的东西。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This section is **never recomputed later**. Recomputing carries survivorship bias, and it throws away the 「warned, and did it anyway」 record — which is the single best predictor of your next rule break."
          }
