    "常见的简化公式「胜率 − 败率 ÷ 盈亏比」算出 %@,那是**每笔愿意亏掉的比例**,换成权利金是 %@ —— 它假设每笔亏损都正好等于平均值。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The common shortcut “win rate − loss rate ÷ payoff ratio” gives %@ — that is the **fraction you put at risk per trade**; as premium it is %@. It assumes every loss is exactly the average loss."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常见的简化公式「胜率 − 败率 ÷ 盈亏比」算出 %@,那是**每笔愿意亏掉的比例**,换成权利金是 %@ —— 它假设每笔亏损都正好等于平均值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "才 %lld 笔付权利金开仓的期权(%lld 个交易日)。凯利对样本极其敏感 —— 攒到 %lld 笔、%lld 个交易日再看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only %lld premium-paid option trades (%lld trading days). Kelly is extremely sensitive to the sample — come back at %lld trades and %lld trading days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "才 %lld 笔付权利金开仓的期权(%lld 个交易日)。凯利对样本极其敏感 —— 攒到 %lld 笔、%lld 个交易日再看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把交易日整天整天地重抽 %@ 次、每次重算:90%% 落在 **%@ 到 %@** 之间,中间值 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resampling whole trading days %@ times and recomputing each time: 90%% fall between **%@ and %@**, median %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把交易日整天整天地重抽 %@ 次、每次重算:90%% 落在 **%@ 到 %@** 之间,中间值 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "曲线是平均每笔的复利增长:半凯利还留着 **%@** 的增长;押到两倍凯利附近,增长就变成负的 —— **押多了比押少了伤得重得多**。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The curve is the average compounded growth per trade: half Kelly keeps **%@** of the growth; around twice Kelly it turns negative — **over-betting hurts far more than under-betting**."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线是平均每笔的复利增长:半凯利还留着 **%@** 的增长;押到两倍凯利附近,增长就变成负的 —— **押多了比押少了伤得重得多**。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 **%@** 的重抽里平均每笔 ≤ 0 —— 也就是这 %lld 个交易日还**证明不了有优势**。": {
