    "算进来的:%lld 笔付权利金开仓的期权,%lld 个交易日。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Included: %lld premium-paid option trades over %lld trading days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "算进来的:%lld 笔付权利金开仓的期权,%lld 个交易日。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 %lld 笔里已经有 %lld 笔归零。再多几笔那样的,满凯利会变成:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Of these %lld trades, %lld already went to zero. With a few more like that, full Kelly becomes:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这 %lld 笔里已经有 %lld 笔归零。再多几笔那样的,满凯利会变成:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 %lld 笔里最差一笔 %@,还**没有归零过**。0DTE 拿到收盘没走就是 −100%% —— 再多几笔那样的,满凯利会变成:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Across these %lld trades the worst was %@, and **none has gone to zero yet**. Holding a 0DTE to the close means −100%% — with a few of those, full Kelly becomes:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这 %lld 笔里最差一笔 %@,还**没有归零过**。0DTE 拿到收盘没走就是 −100%% —— 再多几笔那样的,满凯利会变成:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个比例有多可靠": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How reliable this fraction is"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个比例有多可靠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是把公式套在你过去的战绩上算出来的,不是建议;模拟假设以后和过去这段时间一样 —— 这是偏乐观的假设。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the formula applied to your past record, not advice. The simulation assumes the future looks like this period — an optimistic assumption."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是把公式套在你过去的战绩上算出来的,不是建议;模拟假设以后和过去这段时间一样 —— 这是偏乐观的假设。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这段战绩**平均每笔不赚钱** —— 凯利公式的答案是 0。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In this record **the average trade loses money** — Kelly’s answer is 0."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段战绩**平均每笔不赚钱** —— 凯利公式的答案是 0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重抽里平均每笔 ≤ 0 的只有 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
