        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没算进来:先收钱的卖方 %lld 笔(没有本金这个分母)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**连 0.05× 凯利都达不到**这条标准 —— 按这段战绩,仓位再小也可能回撤这么深。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Even 0.05× Kelly misses** this standard — on this record, any size can draw down that deep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**连 0.05× 凯利都达不到**这条标准 —— 按这段战绩,仓位再小也可能回撤这么深。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "书上常见的回撤公式 (1−d)^(2/c−1) 假设优势是确定的、没有极端亏损 —— 套在这段战绩上会把回撤风险低估很多,所以这里用模拟。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The textbook drawdown formula (1−d)^(2/c−1) assumes a known edge and no extreme losses — on this record it would badly understate the risk, so these numbers are simulated."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "书上常见的回撤公式 (1−d)^(2/c−1) 假设优势是确定的、没有极端亏损 —— 套在这段战绩上会把回撤风险低估很多,所以这里用模拟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
