    "在甜点区内": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In sweet zone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在甜点区内"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "怎么算的:把「%@ 是从 %lld 个交易日估出来的」算进去 —— 估多了就会押多,而押多的代价比押少大。三种算法:偏差校正 %@ · 解析 %@ · 两层重抽 %@。差这么多,是因为都取决于真实优势有多大,而这正是这 %lld 天说不清的 —— 所以给一段,不给一个点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How: it accounts for %@ being estimated from %lld trading days — overestimate it and you overbet, which costs more than underbetting. Three methods: bias-corrected %@ · analytic %@ · double bootstrap %@. They differ because each depends on the true edge, which these %lld days can’t pin down — hence a range, not a point."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "怎么算的:把「%@ 是从 %lld 个交易日估出来的」算进去 —— 估多了就会押多,而押多的代价比押少大。三种算法:偏差校正 %@ · 解析 %@ · 两层重抽 %@。差这么多,是因为都取决于真实优势有多大,而这正是这 %lld 天说不清的 —— 所以给一段,不给一个点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把估计误差算进去以后,**增长最大的倍数接近 0** —— 这段战绩还证明不了有优势。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once estimation error is accounted for, **the growth-maximizing multiple is close to 0** — this record can’t yet prove an edge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把估计误差算进去以后,**增长最大的倍数接近 0** —— 这段战绩还证明不了有优势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每多承受 1%% 的回撤换来的增长(占满凯利):从 0.05× 时的 %@ 平滑降到 1× 时的 %@,没有拐点 —— 段内选哪里,看你能忍多深的回撤(用下面的反查)。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Growth gained per extra 1%% of drawdown (as a share of full Kelly): from %@ at 0.05× smoothly down to %@ at 1×, with no kink — where to sit inside the zone depends on how deep a drawdown you can stand (use the lookup below)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每多承受 1%% 的回撤换来的增长(占满凯利):从 0.05× 时的 %@ 平滑降到 1× 时的 %@,没有拐点 —— 段内选哪里,看你能忍多深的回撤(用下面的反查)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每多承受 1%% 的回撤换来的增长,在 %@ 附近突然变差 —— 那里是拐点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Growth gained per extra 1%% of drawdown drops sharply around %@ — that is the kink."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每多承受 1%% 的回撤换来的增长,在 %@ 附近突然变差 —— 那里是拐点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
