            "value": "约 **%@–%@ 凯利**:每笔预算的 %@–%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**超过 1× 押得越多、增长越少**:1.2× 只剩 %@,1.5× 只剩 %@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Above 1×, more size means less growth**: 1.2× keeps only %@, 1.5× only %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**超过 1× 押得越多、增长越少**:1.2× 只剩 %@,1.5× 只剩 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**超过 1× 押得越多、增长越少**:1.2× 只剩 %@,1.5× 变成负的。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Above 1×, more size means less growth**: 1.2× keeps only %@, 1.5× turns negative."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**超过 1× 押得越多、增长越少**:1.2× 只剩 %@,1.5× 变成负的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "押得越多,平均增长先升后降;押过了头,增长反而变少": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Average growth rises then falls with size; past the peak, more size means less growth"
