    "**亏单比赢单拿得久**:赢单中位 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— 随机分组做到这么大差别的概率只有 %3$@。赚了早走、亏了拿着等回本,交易心理里管这叫「处置效应」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Losers are held longer than winners**: median winner %1$@, median loser %2$@ — random grouping produces a gap this large only %3$@ of the time. Taking gains early and holding losers to get back to even is what trading psychology calls the “disposition effect”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**亏单比赢单拿得久**:赢单中位 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— 随机分组做到这么大差别的概率只有 %3$@。赚了早走、亏了拿着等回本,交易心理里管这叫「处置效应」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**拿得越久,盈亏越好**:相关系数 %1$@,p = %2$@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The longer the hold, the better the P&L**: correlation %1$@, p = %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**拿得越久,盈亏越好**:相关系数 %1$@,p = %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**拿得越久,盈亏越差**:相关系数 %1$@,p = %2$@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The longer the hold, the worse the P&L**: correlation %1$@, p = %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**拿得越久,盈亏越差**:相关系数 %1$@,p = %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**赢单比亏单拿得久**:赢单中位 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— 随机分组做到这么大差别的概率只有 %3$@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Winners are held longer than losers**: median winner %1$@, median loser %2$@ — random grouping produces a gap this large only %3$@ of the time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**赢单比亏单拿得久**:赢单中位 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— 随机分组做到这么大差别的概率只有 %3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
