    "才 %1$lld 笔开平仓时间都知道(赢 %2$lld、亏 %3$lld),还比不出赢单亏单拿多久 —— 攒到 %4$lld 笔、两边各 %5$lld 笔再看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only %1$lld trades have both entry and exit times (%2$lld wins, %3$lld losses) — too few to compare how long winners and losers are held. Come back at %4$lld trades with at least %5$lld on each side."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "才 %1$lld 笔开平仓时间都知道(赢 %2$lld、亏 %3$lld),还比不出赢单亏单拿多久 —— 攒到 %4$lld 笔、两边各 %5$lld 笔再看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
