            "value": "Overall, “the longer the hold, the worse (or better)” can’t be established: correlation %1$@, p = %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整体上「拿得越久越亏(或越赚)」说不准:相关系数 %1$@,p = %2$@。"
