        }
      }
    },
    "没算进来:%lld 笔开仓或平仓时间是估的,或是旧版没认出时间时填的 11:00(在复盘页改成真实时间就会算进来)。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not included: %lld trades whose entry or exit time is estimated, or is the 11:00 placeholder from older versions (fix the time on the review page and they will be included)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没算进来:%lld 笔开仓或平仓时间是估的,或是旧版没认出时间时填的 11:00(在复盘页改成真实时间就会算进来)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "赢单中位拿 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— **差别和随机分组差不多大**(p = %3$@),看不出赢亏和拿多久有关。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Median winner held %1$@, median loser %2$@ — **about the same as random grouping** (p = %3$@); no sign that holding time relates to winning or losing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "赢单中位拿 %1$@,亏单中位 %2$@ —— **差别和随机分组差不多大**(p = %3$@),看不出赢亏和拿多久有关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
